sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Browser
  participant P1 as Login service
  participant P2 as Identity store
  participant P3 as Session store
  P0->>P1: Submit credentials over TLS
  P1->>P2: Verify using password-hash library
  P2->>P1: Identity result
  P1->>P3: Create new random session ID
  P1->>P0: Secure HttpOnly cookie
  P0->>P1: Cookie plus CSRF-bound mutation
  P1->>P3: Load session and check expiry
  P1->>P0: Authorized result or denial
